# GMEOW Ontology Documentation

> A reasoning-centric, OWL 2 DL, gUFO-grounded super-vocabulary that unifies a person's or organization's digital existence (entities, contacts, email, trust/keys, time) and aligns it to schema.org, FOAF, PROV, the WOT schema, Wikidata, and more.

Vocabulary 5. Namespace: https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/. Complete inlined form — every term, its definition, and its usage advice in full.

